---
---
<section id="services" class="services">
  <div class="inner">
    <div data-reveal class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">// Our Services</span>
      <h2>Roofing Built for Southern Weather</h2>
      <p>From homes to businesses, we protect what matters across Alabama &amp; Georgia.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <article data-reveal class="reveal-delay-1 card">
        <div class="photo">
          <img
            src="/images/service-residential.jpg"
            alt="First Class Roofing crew installing a new residential shingle roof"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="icon-tile"><i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney"></i></span>
          <h3>Residential Roofing</h3>
          <p>
            Protect your home and family against tough Southern storms,
            humidity, and heat. From complete tear-offs and full roof
            replacements to fast leak repairs and routine checkups, we
            deliver flawless residential roofing built to withstand Alabama
            and Georgia weather.
          </p>
          <a href="#top" data-scroll class="cta-link">Get a Free Estimate <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article data-reveal class="reveal-delay-4 card">
        <div class="photo">
          <img
            src="/images/service-commercial.jpg"
            alt="First Class Roofing commercial crew completing a flat roof retrofit"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="icon-tile"><i class="fa-solid fa-building"></i></span>
          <h3>Commercial Roofing</h3>
          <p>
            Keep your local business running without costly downtime. We
            provide Alabama and Georgia commercial properties with low-slope
            and flat roof systems, TPO, EPDM, preventative maintenance, and
            durable commercial coatings designed for energy efficiency and
            long-term protection.
          </p>
          <a href="#top" data-scroll class="cta-link">Get a Free Estimate <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services {
    background: #fff;
    padding: var(--section-pad);
  }

  .inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-head {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 46px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: var(--h2);
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-top: 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  }

  .section-head p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--lead);
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 26px;
  }

  .card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(27, 43, 72, 0.04);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 44px -20px rgba(27, 43, 72, 0.3);
    border-color: var(--card-hover-border);
  }

  .photo {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    position: relative;
    background: var(--placeholder-glyph);
  }

  .photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .card-body {
    padding: 26px 26px 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .icon-tile {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #fff;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .card-body h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--navy);
  }

  .card-body p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 12px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .cta-link {
    margin-top: 20px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .cta-link i {
    font-size: 12px;
  }
</style>
